<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <nav class="flex mb-8 text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium uppercase tracking-wider" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <%= link_to "Home", root_path, class: "hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors" %>
    <span class="mx-2 text-slate-300">›</span>
    <span class="text-slate-800">Privacy Policy</span>
  </nav>

  <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-6">
    Privacy Policy
  </h1>
  <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mb-10">
    Last updated: August 11, 2026
  </p>

  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      At VisaSponsorUK, we take the privacy of our visitors seriously. This Privacy Policy documents the types of information we collect and record, and how we use it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      We do not require users to create an account or provide personal details to search our directory. We only collect details you choose to share with us directly (such as via our contact form), and standard web log statistics (IP addresses, browser type, referral pages, and timestamps) gathered by our hosting server to maintain service stability.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-3">2. Cookies and Consent</h2>
    <p>
      We use cookies to analyze web traffic, remember user preferences, and display relevant advertising content. You can manage your cookie preferences at any time using the preferences banner in your browser.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-3">3. How We Use Data</h2>
    <p>
      All public company and licensing records displayed on our platform are sourced directly from official public databases (the UK Home Office and Companies House) in accordance with the Open Government Licence v3.0. We do not sell or lease any user-submitted contact data to third parties.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-3">4. Security</h2>
    <p>
      We employ standard technical measures, including SSL encryption, to safeguard all communications and search logging records against unauthorized access.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-3">5. Contact Information</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy queries or requests to update business records, please get in touch with our team via our <%= link_to "Contact Page", contact_path, class: "text-indigo-600 hover:underline font-semibold" %>.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
